<title>USA: Harry's Farmers Q1 April 30 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Harry's Farmers Q1 April 30 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ROSWELL, Ga. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1Q/FY98		 1Q/FY97</p>
<p>					  Three Mos	     Three Mos</p>
<p>					     Ended		   Ended</p>
<p>				     Apr 30, 1997	   May 1, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			  $34,004,000	   $33,514,000</p>
<p> Cost of Goods Sold	   ( 25,070,000)	 ( 24,567,000)</p>
<p> Gross Profit			 8,934,000	     8,947,000</p>
<p> Operating Expenses	    ( 9,104,000)	  ( 8,916,000)</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from</p>
<p>  Operations			 ( 170,000)		  31,000</p>
<p> Other income			 1,685,000		 431,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		    793,000	    ( 319,000)</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) per common</p>
<p>  share					 .12		  ( .05)</p>
<p>Number of Common Shares and</p>
<p>  Common Equivalent Shares	6,432,000	     6,168,000</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Harry's Farmers Market Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it recorded a nonrecurring gain of $1.4 million from the sale of intellectual property to Progressive Food Concepts Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
